Caus. श्रथ॑यति, ˚ते (in Saṃhitāpāṭha also श्रथायति and accord. to Gr. also श्राथयति and श्रन्थयति [cf. below]; aor. अशिश्रथत् [3. sg. Subj. शिश्रथत् and 3. pl. Impv. शिश्रथन्तु, RV.] or अशश्रन्थत्), to loosen, untie, unbend, slacken, relax (Ā. ‘to become loose, yield’), RV.; AitBr.;
to remit, pardon (sin), RV.;
 (श्राथयति), to strive eagerly, endeavour, use exertion, Dhātup. xxxii, 13;
to delight, gladden, ib.;
 (श्रन्थयति), to bind, tie, connect, arrange, Dhātup. xxxiv, 31;
to hurt, kill, ib.

